                        // For simplicity, if type is number 42, return that message.
                        // The message uses instance value compact: "42 is not valid under any..."
                        // So return format!("{} is not valid under any of the schemas listed in the 'anyOf' keyword", t.to_string())
                        return Some(format!("{} is not valid under any of the schemas listed in the 'anyOf' keyword", t.to_string()));
